    intro: "Not that I have already obtained this or am already perfect, but I press on to make it my own, because Christ Jesus has made me his own. Forgetting what lies behind and straining forward to what lies ahead, I press on toward the goal for the prize of the upward call of God in Christ Jesus. The same Paul who wrote about contentment also pressed on. Contentment and godly striving belong together.",
