    summary: "Discontent is cultivated by comparison. This lesson studies Psalm 73:1-17, Proverbs 14:30, Ecclesiastes 4:4, Exodus 20:17 and James 4:1-3 to see how envy rots the heart, how Asaph nearly slipped when he compared himself with the wicked, how modern advertising and social media stimulate desire, and practical ways to guard the heart through perspective, gratitude, limits and worship.",
    scripture: ["Psalm 73:1-17", "Proverbs 14:30"], more: ["Ecclesiastes 4:4", "Exodus 20:17", "James 4:1-3"], memory: "Proverbs 14:30",
