    sa: ["Why is gratitude important and how can it be practised?", ["thanks", "benefits", "contentment", "daily", "list", "faith"], "A good answer says gratitude shifts attention to God's gifts, reduces envy and anxiety, and is practised daily through prayer, lists, sharing stories and thanking people, including in hardship."],
